# Web UI

- shadcn/ui for primitives. Compose pages from those; do not restyle each instance with hex.
- Tokens live in `docs/design/theme.css`. On scaffold, copy into `globals.css` (`:root` + font imports).
- Colors/radii: cool gray canvas `#F4F4F6`, white cards, primary `#D9643A` with **white** label text, secondary `#296194`, tertiary `#006A61`, radius `0.25rem` (cards and controls). Pills stay full.
- Fonts: Noto Serif headlines, IBM Plex Sans body, Fira Sans labels. `tabular-nums` on metrics and timestamps.
- No Geist. No warm-ivory palette. No charcoal-on-terracotta primary buttons.
- App Router; server components by default. Talk to Go over OpenAPI; no business rules in Next.
